The Normcore V2 uses a 38mm conical burr and has a clean, modern look. It's built to cover a lot of brew methods, from French press to pour over.

A solid all-rounder if you want one grinder for most of what you brew. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
